  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mover><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mrow></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><msub><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><msub><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>,</mo></math> where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><msub><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> is parallel to <math><mover><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mrow></mover></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><msub><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> is perpendicular to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><msub><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><msub><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> is equal to:"
  },
